{"id":54387,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=54387"},"modified":"2026-10-27T15:26:53","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T14:26:53","slug":"trail-da-carcoda","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-da-carcoda\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail da C\u00e1rcoda 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail da C\u00e1rcoda 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail da C\u00e1rcoda 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>29 de novembro de 2026<\/strong>, com partida, secretariado e chegada no <strong>Campo Desportivo Marques Veloso<\/strong> (GPS: 40.787178, -8.111717), na freguesia de Carvalhais (Uni\u00e3o de Freguesias de Carvalhais e Candal), concelho de <strong>S\u00e3o Pedro do Sul<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Viseu<\/strong>). O programa arranca \u00e0s <strong>09:30<\/strong> com o Trail de 19 km, seguindo-se o Mini Trail de 10 km \u00e0s <strong>10:00<\/strong> e a Caminhada de 8 km \u00e0s <strong>10:10<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Inspirado na emblem\u00e1tica Rota da C\u00e1rcoda e nos trilhos da <strong>Serra da Arada<\/strong>, em plena regi\u00e3o de Laf\u00f5es, o percurso atravessa zonas florestais, ribeiros, caminhos rurais e o hist\u00f3rico <strong>Castro da C\u00e1rcoda<\/strong>, um dos mais importantes povoados castrejos da Beira Alta. O <strong>Trail de 19 km (900m D+)<\/strong> \u00e9 destinado a maiores de 18 anos (com abastecimento ao km 9 e na meta), o <strong>Mini Trail de 10 km (300m D+)<\/strong> \u00e9 aberto a partir dos 15 anos no escal\u00e3o Jovem (com abastecimento ao km 4 e na meta) e a <strong>Caminhada de 8 km<\/strong> (\u2265 14 anos, abastecimento ao km 4 e na meta) percorre as ruelas e trilhos em redor de Carvalhais. \u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio o transporte de manta t\u00e9rmica, telem\u00f3vel e apito (sob pena de 1 hora de penaliza\u00e7\u00e3o).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pelo <strong>Carvalhais FC Runners<\/strong> e pelo <strong>Carvalhais FC<\/strong>, com o apoio do Munic\u00edpio de S\u00e3o Pedro do Sul e da Uni\u00e3o de Freguesias de Carvalhais e Candal, o evento inclui no valor da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o t-shirt t\u00e9cnica alusiva \u00e0 prova, medalha, senha para almo\u00e7o, brindes, seguro desportivo, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos e duches no Campo Desportivo Marques Veloso, com entrega de pr\u00e9mios \u00e0s 14:00. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">29 de Novembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Campo Desportivo Marques Veloso, Carvalhais, S\u00e3o Pedro do Sul, Viseu<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" s